  "prefLabel": "We 602.04 Discharge of Chlorinated Water",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 602.04 Discharge of Chlorinated Water. Chlorinated water flushed or pumped from a well following disinfection shall not be discharged into any surface water of the state.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 600) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
